emscripten: on wasm64 (memory64), the pointers EM_JS functions get are
BigInts, which stringToUTF8 cannot mix with numbers ("Cannot mix BigInt
and other types") when InitWindow asks for the canvas id.

--- a/src/c/vendor/raylib/src/platforms/rcore_web.c
+++ b/src/c/vendor/raylib/src/platforms/rcore_web.c
@@
     var canvasId = "#" + Module.canvas.id;
-    stringToUTF8(canvasId, out, outSize);
+    stringToUTF8(canvasId, Number(out), outSize);
 });
